  "releaseNotes": "* Default the SmtpClient/Pop3Client/ImapClient.SslProtocols to the ServicePointManager.SecurityProtocol value in .NET Framework (net4x). (issue #1952)\n* Added support for.NET 10.\n* Marked IMailService.SslCipherAlgorithm, SslCipherStrength, SslHashAlgorithm, SslHashStrength, SslKeyExchangeAlgorithm, and SslKeyExchangeStrength as Obsolete in .NET 10 in favor of the IMailService.SslCipherSuite property (.NET 10 only).\n* Bumped MimeKit dependency to 4.15.0.",
